  "title": "MolEmb: Multimodal Large Language Models Can Be Strong Molecular Embedding Models",
  "summary": "MolEmb introduces a lightweight framework that adapts MLLMs by aligning molecular profiles with textual descriptions in a shared embedding space, enabling competitive results in molecular property prediction and cross-modal retrieval. This work suggests that MLLMs are not merely chemistry assistants but a viable pathway to general molecular embedding models.",
